values.doc:
Nothing was traded and the whole amount stays on the account, or, with
 reason MINIMUM_NOT_MET, a fill netted less than the accepted minimum rate;
 reason says why, and the amounts show what was traded.

fields.doc:
Positive source amount to spend, in 18-decimal units (0.5 is
 500000000000000000). Only whole order steps of the market are traded;
 the rest stays on the account.
